'''Frostfire Sledge''' is a version of [[Nord Sledge]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Blunt|blunt damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* The primary attack slams the ground ''(after a lengthy swing delay)'', dealing damage, 2x the damage as staggering and knocking back everything in a spherical area of effect with a radius of 4 meters.
* It has no secondary attack.

An upgraded Nord Sledge will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Sledge.

